<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Firestorm</h1>
<p>Sphere: Fire Sphere
Spell Tier: 3
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 28)
Mana: 30
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast firestorm &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast firestorm</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster utters 'Maelstra incerinata!' and points, and flaming droplets 
rain down around the target. The better your magic and your fire sphere, 
the more it burns. It does a little better against clothes and light 
leather than against heavier armour, and a shield softens it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
